            },
            {
              "type": "Spacer",
              "height": 16
            },
            {
              "type": "Text",
              "content": "When you service with Nissan during your 5-year warranty period, you'll earn an additional year of coverage. Keep servicing with us and we'll extend it year by year — up to a maximum of 10 years or 300,000km (whichever comes first)*.",
